==============================================================================
green NK 385 cells, red NK 650 cells, 16227 genes
median UMI/cell: green 5645  red 5282  ratio red/green = 0.936
  green by hour: 24h 5531 (n=97)  72h 5736 (n=288)
  red   by hour: 24h 4919 (n=229)  72h 5533 (n=421)

gate (BASELINE side only): p_green >= 0.05 and >= 10 positive green cells -> 7239 genes
  [for reference, S-3's two-sided gate would keep 6753]
  the two-sided gate is NOT used here: gating on the red side is gating on the outcome,
  and would drop exactly the genes with the largest falls -- the ones §2 is about.

observed drop ratio: median +0.106  IQR [-0.020, +0.234]
observed Spearman(p_green, drop ratio) = +0.0333  p = 0.00456

