4. THE TEST -- residual of observed against the matched null
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
c is chosen to match the OVERALL level (median drop ratio), so that
only the SHAPE is compared. Two anchors are reported.
  observed median drop ratio        : 0.1060
  level-matched c (fine grid)       : 0.87  (null median drop 0.1067)
  depth-implied c (median UMI ratio): 0.936

  --- null c = 0.87 (level-matched) ---
      residual: median +0.0142  IQR [-0.1255, +0.1328]
      Spearman(p_green, residual) = +0.1295  p = 1.95e-28

  --- null c = 0.94 (depth-implied) ---
      residual: median +0.0627  IQR [-0.0675, +0.1866]
      Spearman(p_green, residual) = +0.0772  p = 4.73e-11

  --- power check: the same residual test on the targeted control ---
      targeted frac 0.1: Spearman(p_green, residual) = -0.9811  p = 0
